@startuml
participant Client
participant "FHIR API" as API
Client->API: DELETE /Task/{oldExecutionID}
API->API: Verify old task status is ready
API-->Client: 204 No Content
Client->API: POST /Task for new professional
API->API: Validate new owner and assignment rights
API-->Client: 201 Created
Client->API: GET /Task?based-on={ServiceRequestID}
API-->Client: Bundle with updated task graph
@enduml
